This is a Next.js 15 App Router project using TypeScript, Tailwind v4,
Framer Motion, Radix UI, and shadcn/ui.

- All components go in /components
- Use CSS variables in globals.css for brand colors
- Use cn() from @/lib/utils for conditional classNames
- Prefer Framer Motion useInView for scroll animations
- "use client" only when component needs interactivity
- font-display class = Cormorant Garamond (headings)
- DM Sans = body text
- Brand colors: cream #F5F0E8, charcoal #1E1C1A, accent #C4956A